WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.202
Plan a believable journey. Choose two places, calculate a route, and read what it demands.

2
00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:07.944
Open World → Travel to plan a route through the saved terrain.

3
00:00:07.944 --> 00:00:13.385
Choose a starting place and a destination on the same landmass.

4
00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:17.598
Keep On foot, then check the season and party size.

5
00:00:17.598 --> 00:00:19.820
Calculate journey to find the route and its costs.

6
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:23.823
The route follows the world’s terrain, roads and crossings.

7
00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:28.842
Scroll down for distance, travel time and the elevation profile.

8
00:00:28.842 --> 00:00:33.856
Read the daily travel journal before you leave.
